Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:07:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 449/488] [DS4.1] NCCL's last-dimension all-gathers
 concatenated in TileLang

When an all-gather along the last dimension is too large for the
one-shot path, NCCL gathers the shards rank-major and torch moved them
side by side (movedim and a reshape copy). Under the TileLang family one
launch moves 16-byte packs into place instead, any dtype.
